      "suggested_repair": "Put the formulas in inline math, for example `$Sq^i(U)$`, `$w_i(\\gamma_r)u_r$`, and `$w_3(\\gamma_2)=0$`."
    },
    {
      "id": "lem-eilenberg-maclane-spaces-of-torsion-abelian-groups-are-rationally-acyclic",
      "source": "items/lem-eilenberg-maclane-spaces-of-torsion-abelian-groups-are-rationally-acyclic.md",
      "pages": [
        "the-serre-spectral-sequence-and-applications"
      ],
      "section": "Statement",
      "lines": [
        47
